flowchart TB
  PR[Pull request] --> Static[Read-only static CI]
  Static --> Unit[Go / Terraform / manifest / policy tests]
  Unit --> Aggregate[Required ci/all-required status]
  Aggregate -->|fail| Block[Block merge]
  Aggregate -->|pass| Main[Protected main]
  Main --> Approval{Protected environment required?}
  Approval --> OIDC[GitHub OIDC -> Google WIF]
  OIDC --> Apply[Apply current layer only]
  Apply --> Contract[Live contract + negative tests]
  Contract --> Cleanup[Cleanup / rollback test]
  Cleanup --> Record[Commit-bound gate record]
  Record --> Next[Next layer can verify prerequisite]
  Apply -->|failure| Evidence[Diagnostics and evidence]
  Contract -->|failure| Evidence
  Evidence --> Stop[Stop all downstream layers]
